  "description": "This skill should be used ONLY when the user explicitly asks to run a structured review *flow* — e.g. \"start a review flow\", \"submit this for review\", \"re-review after I address findings\", or wants an iterative review loop run by a separate reviewer that continues until sign-off. Do NOT use this skill (and do NOT call the flows MCP tools) for an ordinary review request such as \"review my PR\", \"review this diff/spec/design\", or \"code review\" where the user just wants you to review it yourself — perform that review directly instead. For any other catalogue flow, or a flow offered from your session context, use `agent-flows`.",
